#. ── Filter tooltips (keep the → · / arrows and separators) ──
msgid "Filter by status — All → Pinned → Unpinned → On screen → Hidden"
msgstr "按状态筛选 — 全部 → 已固定 → 未固定 → 屏幕上 → 已隐藏"

